{
    "title": "Libby, the Library App",
    "description": "All over the world, local libraries offer millions of ebooks and audiobooks. You can borrow them \u2014 for free, instantly \u2014 with a library card and Libby: the award-winning, much-loved app for libraries.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Browse your library\u2019s digital catalog of books \u2014 from classics to NYT best-sellers\r\n\u2022 Borrow and enjoy ebooks, audiobooks, and magazines\r\n\u2022 Download titles for offline reading, or stream them to save space\r\n\u2022 Send ebooks to your Kindle (U.S. libraries only)\r\n\u2022 Listen to audiobooks via Android Auto\r\n\u2022 Use tags to create your must-read list and any other book lists you want\r\n\u2022 Keep your reading position automatically synced on all your devices\r\n\r\nIn our beautiful, intuitive ebook reader:\r\n\u2022 Adjust text size, background color, and book design\r\n\u2022 Zoom into magazines and comic books\r\n\u2022 Define and search for words and phrases\r\n\u2022 Read and listen to read-alongs with your kids\r\n\u2022 Add bookmarks, notes, and highlights\r\n\r\nIn our ground-breaking audio player:\r\n\u2022 Slow down or speed up the audio (0.6 to 3.0x)\r\n\u2022 Set a sleep timer\r\n\u2022 Simply swipe to skip forward and backward\r\n\u2022 Add bookmarks, notes, and highlights\r\n\r\nLibby is built by the team at OverDrive, in support of local libraries everywhere.\r\n\r\nHappy reading!",
    "descriptionHTML": "All over the world, local libraries offer millions of ebooks and audiobooks. You can borrow them \u2014 for free, instantly \u2014 with a library card and Libby: the award-winning, much-loved app for libraries.<br><br>\u2022 Browse your library\u2019s digital catalog of books \u2014 from classics to NYT best-sellers<br>\u2022 Borrow and enjoy ebooks, audiobooks, and magazines<br>\u2022 Download titles for offline reading, or stream them to save space<br>\u2022 Send ebooks to your Kindle (U.S. libraries only)<br>\u2022 Listen to audiobooks via Android Auto<br>\u2022 Use tags to create your must-read list and any other book lists you want<br>\u2022 Keep your reading position automatically synced on all your devices<br><br>In our beautiful, intuitive ebook reader:<br>\u2022 Adjust text size, background color, and book design<br>\u2022 Zoom into magazines and comic books<br>\u2022 Define and search for words and phrases<br>\u2022 Read and listen to read-alongs with your kids<br>\u2022 Add bookmarks, notes, and highlights<br><br>In our ground-breaking audio player:<br>\u2022 Slow down or speed up the audio (0.6 to 3.0x)<br>\u2022 Set a sleep timer<br>\u2022 Simply swipe to skip forward and backward<br>\u2022 Add bookmarks, notes, and highlights<br><br>Libby is built by the team at OverDrive, in support of local libraries everywhere.<br><br>Happy reading!",
